{{also|stube}}
==German==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|de|la|grc}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|stube}}, from {{inh|de|goh|stuba}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*stobu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃtuːbə/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Stube.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f|dim=^chen,^lein}}

# {{lb|de|regional}} [[living room]]
#: {{syn|de|Wohnzimmer}}
# [[room]] {{gl|a room used for a special purpose; the term is often found in compounds with a somewhat old-fashioned character}}
# [[parlour]] {{gl|a room used chiefly for representation purposes; often called a {{m|de|gute Stube}} or the like}}
# the [[heated]] part of a traditional [[farmhouse]] (as opposed to stables, kitchen, etc.)
# {{lb|de|military}} [[bedroom]] in a [[barracks]]

